WEBVTT

33:01.047 --> 33:03.508
He likes to do this when I'm on duty.

33:03.633 --> 33:05.677
He makes me listen
as he insults my sister.

33:05.802 --> 33:09.305
- (DOOR OPENS)
- (LAUGHTER)

33:11.558 --> 33:13.601
- Forgive me, my lord...
- Why do I have to forgive you?

33:13.726 --> 33:15.144
Have you wronged me?

33:17.021 --> 33:21.442
- We've met before, you know.
- Have we? Strange, I've forgotten.

33:21.943 --> 33:25.196
The siege of Pyke.
We fought side by side one afternoon.

33:25.321 --> 33:27.031
Ah.

33:27.156 --> 33:29.075
- That's where you got your scar?
- Aye.

33:29.200 --> 33:32.370
- Oh.
- One of the Greyjoys nearly took my eye.
